## 📂 Project Structure

```
teahound/
├── src/
│   ├── scanner.py        # Core scanner engine & CLI entry point
│   ├── gitea_client.py   # Gitea REST API interaction client
│   └── rules.yaml        # YAML detection rules definition
├── design/               # Architecture & rule specifications
├── docs/                 # Methodology & workflow documentation
├── test_repo/            # Multi-language test fixtures (Flask, Express)
├── pyproject.toml        # Package & CLI metadata
├── requirements.txt      # Python dependencies
├── LICENSE               # MIT License
└── README.md             # Project documentation
```

